K_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20819,"speakerName":"ジャヴィ","textMapHash":743599210,"text":"「『ヴァナラ』になって、ずっと森の中で暮らしたい…」","nextNodeIds":[731090314]},{"nodeId":731090314,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20819,"speakerName":"ジャヴィ","textMapHash":2909185626,"text":"これが俺の子供の頃の夢？まったく、あの頃は何を考えていたのか…","nextNodeIds":[731090315]},{"nodeId":731090315,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20819,"speakerName":"ジャヴィ","textMapHash":1962120042,"text":"はぁ、あの頃の俺に言ってやりたい。ヴァナラは簡単にモラを稼げる仕事じゃないぞ。","nextNodeIds":[731090316,731090317]},{"nodeId":731090316,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2103650778,"text":"いいと思う。","nextNodeIds":[731090318]},{"nodeId":731090318,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20819,"speakerName":"ジャヴィ","textMapHash":3063879178,"text":"そう思うのは子供だからだ。この歳になると、夢なんて…","nextNodeIds":[731090319]},{"nodeId":731090319,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20819,"speakerName":"ジャヴィ","textMapHash":4194756226,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[731090320]},{"nodeId":731090320,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20819,"speakerName":"ジャヴィ","textMapHash":1851650842,"text":"どうすればモラをもっと稼げるか、どうすれば夜にぐっすり眠れるようになるか…そんなことばかりになる。","nextNodeIds":[731090321]},{"nodeId":731090321,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20819,"speakerName":"ジャヴィ","textMapHash":3107375170,"text":"ふう、俺のくだらない夢よりも、問題はアミの夢についてだ。","nextNodeIds":[731090322]},{"nodeId":731090322,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20819,"speakerName":"ジャヴィ","textMapHash":3349149058,"text":"彼女の「夢の箱」を開けてしまったからには、お詫びに何かしなければならない。","nextNodeIds":[731090323]},{"nodeId":731090323,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20819,"speakerName":"ジャヴィ","textMapHash":132427162,"text":"うーん…そうだな、彼女は花職人になりたいと思っていたわけだから、まずは花の育て方を学ぶ必要がある。","nextNodeIds":[731090324]},{"nodeId":731090324,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20819,"speakerName":"ジャヴィ","textMapHash":4156821258,"text":"ちょうど俺のところに使っていない植木鉢があるから、彼女にあげよう。","nextNodeIds":[731090325]},{"nodeId":731090325,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20819,"speakerName":"ジャヴィ","textMapHash":2622477298,"text":"旅人、花の種を手に入れる方法は知っているか？","nextNodeIds":[731090326,731090327]},{"nodeId":731090326,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3578327362,"text":"任せて。","nextNodeIds":[731090332]},{"nodeId":731090332,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20819,"speakerName":"ジャヴィ","textMapHash":378551570,"text":"それじゃ、種の件は君に任せた、旅人。後でジャハンギルの店の傍で会おう。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":731090327,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3498494938,"text":"どうしてそんなことを？","nextNodeIds":[731090328]},{"nodeId":731090328,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20819,"speakerName":"ジャヴィ","textMapHash":194040706,"text":"ははは…ただの気まぐれだ。","nextNodeIds":[731090329]},{"nodeId":731090329,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20819,"speakerName":"ジャヴィ","textMapHash":2916904922,"text":"今の俺は夢なんてものを追うことはできない。もう若くないというのもあるし…昔の夢に、あまり興味がないんだ。","nextNodeIds":[731090330]},{"nodeId":731090330,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20819,"speakerName":"ジャヴィ","textMapHash":1276147306,"text":"でも、アミはまだ若い。彼女なら自分の夢を実現するために頑張れるはずだ。","nextNodeIds":[731090331]},{"nodeId":731090331,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20819,"speakerName":"ジャヴィ","textMapHash":3968098858,"text":"つまらない大人の俺にできることは何もない。せめて植木鉢をプレゼントすることで、彼女の励みになるといいんだが。","nextNodeIds":[731090332]},{"nodeId":731090317,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3839569266,"text":"夢にいいも悪いもない。","nextNodeIds":[731090318]},{"nodeId":731090310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2065343738,"text":"#これが{M#君}{F#あなた}の「夢の箱」だ。","nextNodeIds":[731090311]},{"nodeId":731090304,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":109671970,"text":"#{M#君}{F#あなた}も箱を掘り出したの？","nextNodeIds":[731090305]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7310903,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActi